// Installed name: TEST - G1A Presence
// Purpose/role: Inspect empty/populated If polarity; independent generation diagnostic.
// Specification revision: 1. Interface: 1.0.
// Input: None.
// Expected previews: EMPTY ABSENT followed by FILLED PRESENT.
// Result: Preview only.// Dependencies: None. Exact installed targets must match source; export filenames do not set installed names.
// Side effects: Previews/prompts only; no saves, renames, imports, metadata or setlist writes.
// Target: iPadOS/Jellycuts versions must be recorded; previous profile iPadOS 26.6 / Jellycuts 2026.6.4. Local comparison Open-Jellycore e1ec31c / Swift 6.4.1.
